        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 519.62,
          "end": 524.02,
          "en": "and then here we add authSlice.reducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 524.02,
          "end": 527.38,
          "en": "And these individual reducers here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 527.38,
          "end": 530.44,
          "en": "will then automatically be merged together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 530.44,
          "end": 532.44,
          "en": "into one main reducer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 532.44,
          "end": 535.15,
          "en": "which is exposed to this store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 535.15,
          "end": 538.26,
          "en": "That's how we can combine multiple slices",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 538.26,
          "end": 540.023,
          "en": "and their reducers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 541.55,
          "end": 543.54,
          "en": "Now, our authSlice, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 543.54,
          "end": 546.92,
          "en": "also exposes actions, which we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 546.92,
          "end": 550.11,
          "en": "and therefore, I wanna expose those as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 550.11,
          "end": 553.45,
          "en": "So export authActions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 553.45,
          "end": 556.363,
          "en": "which is authSlice.actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 557.58,
          "end": 560.37,
          "en": "So now we added this authSlice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 560.37,
          "end": 563.83,
          "en": "Let's now use it in our different components",
